<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian 3,5-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian 3,5-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an 11th tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) and an 11th tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of five-year Btps, both carrying an 8.25 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   July 1,1999	Pvs    July 1,2001    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.95 pct    7.21 pct    7.27 pct     7.59 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     8.02 pct    8.27 pct    8.36 pct     8.68 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  100.95	100.35     100.20	 99.00</p>
<p> Bids	    4.879 trln lire	  5.278 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	2.500 trln lire	  2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on August 30 of a ninth tranche of three and five-year Btps.</p>
</text>
